), IN (-0.6k), &amp; MD (-0.3k) https://t.co/MBjWlOMVAR", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2120873577540984864"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:18:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120868891660529719"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 98, "start": 93, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/fabknowledge/s…", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/fabknowledge/status/2120666492723425689", "start": 199, "url": "https://t.co/DXqi2NP4yt"}]}, "id": "2120868891660529719", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 22102, "like_count": 110, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "I understand why there are so many people in the industry who don’t want Jensen gone. But if $NVDA were to keep him, wouldn’t it make more sense to put in a new, strong independent chairman instead? https://t.co/DXqi2NP4yt", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120868891660529719"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:53:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120862612049342799"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 59, "start": 54, "tag": "NVDA"}]}, "id": "2120862612049342799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 26876, "like_count": 285, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "When it comes to AI’s circular financing. How much of $NVDA’s backing of the space is about juicing and sustaining demand, vs. a logical desire to ensure intense competition at every other part of the stack (cloud, model, etc) to prevent the emergence of a monopsony player.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120862612049342799"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:34:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120857838612615496"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 194, "id": "1078403208194785280", "start": 184, "username": "DataArbor"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/I3te2YbOxy", "end": 218, "expanded_url": "https